{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Charlotte part en safari", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "R\u00e9visons ! Pr\u00eate \u00e0 partir", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 6, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "L'apprenant identifie et d\u00e9crit des plans concernant l'organisation d'\u00e9v\u00e9nements.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "L'expression de la condition", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "On peut exprimer la condition avec la structure <span class=\"italic\"> si + pr\u00e9sent de l'indicatif + pr\u00e9sent/futur de l'indicatif ou imp\u00e9ratif</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Si vous visitez l'Afrique, vous devez absolument faire un tour des r\u00e9serves de faune \u00e0 bord d'un h\u00e9licopt\u00e8re.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Je reviendrai en Afrique sans faute si j'ai la chance.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Le futur simple", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Le futur simple exprime un fait ou une action qui se d\u00e9roulera plus tard, elle n'a pas encore eu lieu au moment o\u00f9 nous nous exprimons.<br/> Pour les verbes se terminant en ER et IR, on prend l'infinitif du verbe et on ajoute la terminaison appropri\u00e9e. Pour les verbes se terminant en RE, on enl\u00e8ve le \"e\" avant d'ajouter la terminaison. <br/> Il y a un certain nombre de verbes irr\u00e9guliers. Dans ces cas, on utilise un radical autre que l'infinitif du verbe.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sujet\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Terminaison\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Revenir\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"je\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"-ai\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"je reviendrai\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tu\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"-as\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tu reviendras\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"il/elle/on\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"-a\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"il/elle/on reviendra\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"nous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"-ons\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"nous reviendrons\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"vous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"-ez\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"vous reviendrez\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ils/elles\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"-ont\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ils/elles reviendront\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "J'ajouterai des photos au blog lorsque j'aurai un moment de libre. Les regarderez-vous ?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Je *reviendrai en Afrique sans faute si j'ai la chance.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "*Le verbe <span class=\"italic\">revenir</span> est irr\u00e9gulier.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le safari ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "excursion pour voir des animaux dans leur habitat naturel", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'arrive d'un safari au S\u00e9n\u00e9gal.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le06ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots que vous utilisez pour parler d'un voyage. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "l'h\u00e9licopt\u00e8re", "type": "name"}, {"content": "appareil volant \u00e0 pales", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Avez-vous d\u00e9j\u00e0 \u00e9t\u00e9 dans un h\u00e9licopt\u00e8re ? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le06ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le mammif\u00e8re", "type": "name"}, {"content": "animal vert\u00e9br\u00e9 qui a des mamelles", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : L'\u00e9l\u00e9phant est le plus grand mammif\u00e8re terrestre.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le06ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le l\u00e9opard", "type": "name"}, {"content": "mammif\u00e8re africain de la famille des chats", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je pense que les l\u00e9opards et les gu\u00e9pards se ressemblent.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le06ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le gu\u00e9pard", "type": "name"}, {"content": "mammif\u00e8re africain de la famille des chats, r\u00e9put\u00e9 pour sa rapidit\u00e9", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Les taches des gu\u00e9pards sont plus petites que celles des l\u00e9opards.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le06ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "frn5le06ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le parc zoologique", "type": "name"}, {"content": "jardin public o\u00f9 sont expos\u00e9s des animaux", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'ai vu beaucoup de mammif\u00e8res au parc zoologique.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le06ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "inoubliable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "m\u00e9morable", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Le safari s\u00e9n\u00e9galais a \u00e9t\u00e9 une exp\u00e9rience inoubliable.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le06ob11aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Regardez une carte de l'Afrique.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choisissez un circuit de cinq pays \u00e0 visiter.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Faites des recherches sur Internet pour trouver une ou deux choses \u00e0 faire ou \u00e0 voir dans chaque pays.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez un paragraphe de 7 \u00e0 8 phrases expliquant votre circuit. Utilisez une phrase conditionnelle avec Si. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Lisez votre paragraphe \u00e0 voix haute.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discutez du voyage.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "Je d\u00e9cris un circuit touristique.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je parle d'un voyage.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je lis mon texte \u00e0 voix haute.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Note professionnelle ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Il est souvent pr\u00e9f\u00e9rable de poser des questions ouvertes au travail afin de laisser place \u00e0 la discussion et d'obtenir des r\u00e9ponses plus approfondies. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Pourquoi exercez-vous ce m\u00e9tier ? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Quelles sont les formations offertes par l'entreprise ? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Pouvez-vous me parler d'un projet que vous avez r\u00e9alis\u00e9 ? ", "type": "example"}]}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}]}, {"title": "", "id": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "frn5le06ob11re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "frn5le06ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "frn5le06ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "frn5le06ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Il y a tellement de choses \u00e0 faire en Afrique ! J'arrive d'un safari au S\u00e9n\u00e9gal. Le safari s\u00e9n\u00e9galais a \u00e9t\u00e9 une exp\u00e9rience inoubliable, mais il n'a pas \u00e9t\u00e9 aussi long que celui de R\u00e9publique d\u00e9mocratique du Congo. J'ajouterai des photos \u00e0 mon blog lorsque j'aurai un moment de libre. Les regarderez-vous ?"}, {"time": "22000", "image": "frn5le06ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "Avez-vous d\u00e9j\u00e0 \u00e9t\u00e9 dans un h\u00e9licopt\u00e8re ? Si vous visitez l'Afrique, vous devez absolument faire un tour des r\u00e9serves de faune \u00e0 bord d'un h\u00e9licopt\u00e8re. Les r\u00e9serves africaines sont beaucoup plus grandes que les parcs nationaux en France."}, {"time": "39000", "image": "frn5le06ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "J'ai fait des randonn\u00e9es p\u00e9destres et je me suis couch\u00e9e dans une tente luxueuse. Avez-vous eu l'occasion de faire \u00e7a ? J'ai eu envie de dormir au c\u0153ur de la nature. On m'a assur\u00e9 que j'\u00e9tais en s\u00e9curit\u00e9. Je n'ai pas eu envie de me faire manger par un lion. J'ai vu beaucoup de mammif\u00e8res au parc zoologique. Je pense que les l\u00e9opards et les gu\u00e9pards se ressemblent. C'est facile de les confondre. Les taches des gu\u00e9pards sont plus petites que celles des l\u00e9opards. Mon f\u00e9lin pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9 est le lion. Les lions sont les plus beaux et les plus int\u00e9ressants."}, {"time": "80000", "image": "frn5le06ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "C'\u00e9tait le meilleur voyage que j'ai fait jusqu'\u00e0 maintenant. Je reviendrai en Afrique sans faute si j'ai la chance. Est-ce que vous viendrez avec moi ?\n<br/><br/>\u00c0 plus, <br/>Charlotte"}]}}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "id": 2, "contents": [], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Je peux exprimer des choses \u00e0 faire lors d'un voyage.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Je peux d\u00e9crire des actions et des \u00e9v\u00e9nements au pass\u00e9.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux comparer des choses.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux parler des \u00e9v\u00e9nements futurs.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Quel a \u00e9t\u00e9 le meilleur voyage que vous ayez fait&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "O\u00f9 \u00eates-vous all\u00e9&nbsp;? Qu'avez-vous fait&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Coin r\u00e9vision.", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1, "questions": []}, {"stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Dans son blog, Charlotte parle de nombreuses choses qu'elle a <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">faites</span> lorsqu'elle \u00e9tait en Afrique.  ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"co